    "updated_at": "2022-12-01T14:20:34Z",
    "body": "Just a preference. I run multiple virtual environments, but usually only one version of Python (only occasionally use pyenv).\r\n\r\nThe version number in the prompt seems to be only triggered by a virtual environment called `.venv`. If I create a virtual environment with another name, and activate it, the name shows up in the prompt, but the version number doesn't.",
